 SplitMate, and FocusFlow.\\n\\nOn hover, each icon subtly glows and scales up (1.2\\u00d7), inviting interaction. Clicking an icon seamlessly navigates the user to its dedicated page.\\n\\nEach sub-tool page maintains a clean, intuitive layout with interactive components like charts, forms, and visual insights, tailored specifically to its purpose. The design emphasizes clarity, user feedback, and engagement, making the tool enjoyable and easy to use for young adults.\\nSmooth page transitions and subtle micro-interactions enhance the user experience, providing a responsive and polished feel throughout the app."\n}'}",
